  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s31",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CT Abdomen and Pelvis with Contrast (___):",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=3564-3606",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s32",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1. Heterogeneous prostate gland mass with extension outside of \nthe capsule and \ninvolvement of the seminal vesicles.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=3607-3724",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s33",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No definite bladder \ninvolvement is \nidentified, but difficult to evaluate for subtle extension on \nthis exam.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=3726-3836",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s34",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2. Innumerable sclerotic lesions throughout the visualized \nbones, compatible \nwith osseous metastatic disease.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=3838-3949",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s36",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "4. Hyperdense nodule associated with a cystic lesion in the \ninterpolar region \nof the left kidney.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4027-4126",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s37",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Although this could represent a hemorrhagic \ncystic \ncomponent, this is incompletely characterized on this exam.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4128-4240",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s38",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "5. Tubular hypodense structure in the pancreatic uncinate \nprocess, most likely \na side branch IPMN.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4242-4342",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s39",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "6. Cholelithiasis, with gallbladder wall thickening but no \nsurrounding \ninflammatory changes.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4344-4438",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s40",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "This is likely due to chronic \ncholecystitis.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4440-4485",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s41",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CT Head (___):",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4488-4502",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s42",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1. No acute intracranial process.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4503-4536",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s43",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Specifically, no intracranial \nhemorrhage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4538-4580",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s44",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2. Global volume loss with ventriculomegaly perhaps out of \nproportion to the sulcal size which raises the possibility of",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4582-4703",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s45",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "NPH.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4705-4709",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s46",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Recommend correlation with physical exam findings.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4711-4761",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s47",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CXR (___):",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4764-4774",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s48",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No evidence of pneumonia.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4779-4804",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s49",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Multiple chronic left posterior and \nright anterior rib fractures.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4806-4872",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Mr. ___ is an ___ gentleman with a past medical history \nof hypertension, hyperlipidemia, progressive cognitive decline \nwith memory loss, now presenting with worsening functional \nstatus and gait disturbance.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=4900-5109",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Metastatic Prostate Cancer: The patient was found to have an \nelevated PSA and an elevated Alk Phos in the setting of normal",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=5112-5238",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ and normal GGT.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=5240-5259",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Metastatic prostate cancer was suspected \ngiven these lab results and the fact that the patient has slowly \nbeen losing weight over the past ___ years.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=5260-5411",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A CT scan of the \nabdomen and pelvis was obtain and showed a prostatic mass \nextending into the seminal vesicles with metastatic spread to \nthe bone.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=5412-5561",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was informed of his prostate cancer \ndiagnosis.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=5562-5621",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Lower Extremity Weakness: When the patient first presented to \nthe hospital, the strength in his extremities was ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=5889-6008",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, \nhe was not able to roll in bed, transfer, or walk on his own.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6009-6080",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Several days after admission, patient was able to ambulate using \na walker and transfer without assistance.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6082-6189",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CT scan of the head \nrevealed that the patient may have normal pressure \nhydrocephalus.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6190-6277",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Normocytic Anemia: Iron studies ___ TIBC, high ferritin, \nand low iron, which is consistent with an anemia of chronic \ndisease and iron deficiency anemia mixed picture.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6387-6557",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "His most \nrecent colonoscopy was at ___ in ___, and was normal.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6558-6621",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \npatient is reporting normal bowel movements without melena.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6622-6686",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "B12 \nand folate are normal.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6687-6714",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was not started on iron \nsupplementation given the constipation side effects of the \nmedication",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6715-6813",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "#Encephalopathy: During the hospitalization, the patient's \nmental status waxed and waned.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6815-6905",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At times he was AAOx3, and knew \nthat he was in ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6906-6958",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Other times, he thought that he was in his \nhome at the ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=6959-7019",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "When he first came the ___ ED, \nhe was evaluated by physical therapy, ___",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7020-7139",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was started on \nthiamine and a multivitamin.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7223-7270",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He had memory issues with his \nprostate cancer diagnosis as detailed above.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7271-7346",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "#Normal Pressure Hydrocephalus: The patient had a CT scan of the \nhead which was suggestive of normal pressure hydrocephalus.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7348-7473",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s26",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \npatient's lower extremity weakness gradually resolved.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7474-7533",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s28",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Hypertension: The patient came into the hospital on atenolol \nfor hypertension.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7737-7818",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s29",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "His blood pressures ranged in the ___ \nsystolic, so his atenolol was stopped in the setting of his gait \ndisturbance.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7819-7936",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s30",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Orthostatic vitals obtained during the \nhospitalization were negative.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=7937-8007",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s31",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Hyperlipidemia: His simvastatin was continued",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=8010-8057",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:MEDADM:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "MEDADM",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The Preadmission Medication list is accurate and complete.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=8703-8761",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:MEDADM:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "MEDADM",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1. Atenolol 25 mg PO DAILY",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=8762-8788",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:MEDADM:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "MEDADM",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2. Simvastatin 10 mg PO QPM",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=8790-8817",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Mental Status: Confused - sometimes.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=9339-9375",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Level of Consciousness: Alert and interactive.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=9376-9422",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Activity Status: Ambulatory - requires assistance or aid (walker \nor cane).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=17350731-DS-12:chars=9423-9498",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-3:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-24T15:42:00",
   "text": "No evidence of pneumonia.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-3:chars=538-563",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-3:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-24T15:42:00",
   "text": "Multiple chronic left posterior and right anterior rib fractures.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-3:chars=565-630",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-4:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-25T18:55:00",
   "text": "1. No acute intracranial process.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-4:chars=1047-1080",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-4:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-25T18:55:00",
   "text": "Specifically, no intracranial hemorrhage.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-4:chars=1082-1123",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-4:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-25T18:55:00",
   "text": "2. Global volume loss with ventriculomegaly perhaps out of proportion to the sulcal size which raises the possibility of NPH.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-4:chars=1124-1249",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-4:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-25T18:55:00",
   "text": "Recommend correlation with physical exam findings.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-4:chars=1251-1301",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "1. Heterogeneous prostate gland mass with extension outside of the capsule and involvement of the seminal vesicles.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=3541-3656",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "No definite bladder involvement is identified, but difficult to evaluate for subtle extension on this exam.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=3658-3765",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "2. Innumerable sclerotic lesions throughout the visualized bones, compatible with osseous metastatic disease.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=3766-3875",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "3. 5.1 x 6.8 x 5.9 cm right pelvic sidewall mass likely nodal metastases.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=3876-3949",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s5",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "4. Hyperdense nodule associated with a cystic lesion in the interpolar region of the left kidney.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=3950-4047",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s6",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "Although this could represent a hemorrhagic cystic component, this is incompletely characterized on this exam.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=4049-4159",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s7",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "5. Tubular hypodense structure in the pancreatic uncinate process, most likely a side branch IPMN.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=4160-4258",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s8",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "6. Cholelithiasis, with gallbladder wall thickening but no surrounding inflammatory changes.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=4259-4351",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:17350731-RR-5:s9",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2130-12-28T17:24:00",
   "text": "This is likely due to chronic cholecystitis.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=17350731-RR-5:chars=4353-4397",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "POE:rehab_therapy",
   "source": "poe",
   "kind": "fact",
   "section": null,
   "available_at": "2130-12-26T15:55:31",
